cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "NeoGravity verification suite: Computational checks for the Theory of NeoGravity & Ether Dynamics"
abstract: "One program that recomputes twenty-seven central claims of the Theory of NeoGravity & Ether Dynamics from its five postulates and the measured inputs, printing PASS, FAIL or NOTE for each and stating where a result is calibrated rather than derived. It exits non-zero if any check fails."
version: "4.2"
date-released: "2026-09-17"
